Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Um, I wanted to bring it to slow food.

asr-001608
01:41:52.310 --> 01:41:55.090
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Um, and, uh, it's just a movement of farmers.

asr-001609
01:41:55.270 --> 01:41:56.970
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: And it started in Italy in 1986.

asr-001610
01:41:57.290 --> 01:42:00.970
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: And it's actually a protest, um, when McDonald's opened in Rome.

asr-001611
01:42:01.390 --> 01:42:03.710
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: And it has grown to more than 160 countries.

asr-001612
01:42:04.210 --> 01:42:05.110
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Um, the idea is simple.

asr-001613
01:42:05.250 --> 01:42:06.090
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Food should be good.

asr-001614
01:42:06.270 --> 01:42:07.130
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: It should be clean.

asr-001615
01:42:07.290 --> 01:42:09.810
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: And the people who grow it should be paid fairly.

asr-001616
