Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Chicken inasal is the number one chicken sa buong mundo.

asr-001618
01:42:15.650 --> 01:42:20.630
Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Uh, marami pa pong pwedeng, uh, gastronomic, um, dishes, no, sa ating bansa.

asr-001619
