DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: And this is in conjunction with our regional offices po,

asr-002064
02:13:07.820 --> 02:13:09.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: ah, just to inform.

asr-002065
02:13:09.820 --> 02:13:12.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Because we have been conducting assessment and report, ah,

asr-002066
02:13:12.820 --> 02:13:15.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: report po yung ginakonduct po ng ating mga regional offices.

asr-002067
02:13:15.820 --> 02:13:20.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: So they would know kung sino po yung mga affected, affected tourism workers,

asr-002068
02:13:20.820 --> 02:13:25.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: establishments and infrastructure to support timely national response and recovery.

asr-002069
02:13:25.820 --> 02:13:30.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: So the DOT, kami po ang nagpa-facilitate ng endorsement po

asr-002070
02:13:30.820 --> 02:13:35.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: ng affected tourism workers to the DSWD at sa LGUs

asr-002071
02:13:35.820 --> 02:13:40.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: for interventions such as yung family food packs and emergency cash transfers.

asr-002072
02:13:40.820 --> 02:13:43.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Now, regarding naman po sa mga tinamaan po,

asr-002073
02:13:43.820 --> 02:13:46.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: halimbawa nasira po yung tourism area,

asr-002074
02:13:46.820 --> 02:13:53.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: sa kasawiang-palad po, wala pong pondo po kasi na inilalaan po ng NDRRMC para sa DOT

asr-002075
02:13:53.820 --> 02:13:58.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: tulad ng ibang mga ahensya ngayong darating na fiscal year 2027.

asr-002076
02:13:58.820 --> 02:14:01.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Hinihiling po namin dati sa loob po ng, ah,

asr-002077
02:14:01.820 --> 02:14:08.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: tier 2 po namin yung 5 million pesos to be incorporated po or to be carried po under the NDRRMC.

asr-002078
02:14:08.820 --> 02:14:09.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Pero hindi po ito, ah,

asr-002079
02:14:09.820 --> 02:14:16.820
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: pero hindi po ito naisama po dito nung lumabas na po yung NEP fiscal year 2027.

asr-002080
02:14:17.820 --> 02:14:19.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Ah, thank you Madam Chair.

asr-002081
02:14:19.820 --> 02:14:22.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Ah, kasi ang usaping ito ay hindi lamang po para sa ating mga,

asr-002082
02:14:22.820 --> 02:14:29.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: sa amin sa Catanduanes, maraming tourism communities nationwide ang exposed din po sa disaster.

asr-002083
02:14:29.820 --> 02:14:35.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, Madam Chair, sa tourism recovery hindi lang po destination ang kailangan ibangon,

asr-002084
02:14:35.820 --> 02:14:38.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: kailangan din masuporta ng malilit na negosyo,

asr-002085
02:14:38.820 --> 02:14:41.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: at tourism workers hanggang makabalik ang operasyon,

asr-002086
02:14:41.820 --> 02:14:47.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: bumalik ang mga, bumalik ang mga turista at maging stable muli ang kanilang kabuhayan

asr-002087
02:14:47.820 --> 02:14:52.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: dahil isa rin po sila sa mga tumutulong upang palaguin ang ating ekonomiya,

asr-002088
02:14:52.820 --> 02:14:56.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: kung kaya narapat lang din po na tulungan natin sila.

asr-002089
02:14:56.820 --> 02:14:59.820
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Thank you po Madam Chair, thank you po Madam Secretary.

asr-002090
02:15:01.460 --> 02:15:07.160
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Thank you, Rep. Rodriguez. Next, to interpellate from the minority, Representative Renee Co.

asr-002091
02:15:10.340 --> 02:15:15.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Chair, and good evening to the Department of Tourism.

asr-002092
02:15:17.100 --> 02:15:26.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro, isa lang naman po yung tanong ko, and it relates to the duty-free shops of, well, the Philippines.

asr-002093
02:15:26.540 --> 02:15:41.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito, I was able to talk to some of my parliamentarian friends from other countries, and visit some duty-free shops din sa kanilang mga bansa.

asr-002094
02:15:41.900 --> 02:15:52.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And yun ay talagang opportunity to showcase yung local businesses, yung kanilang mga innovations, and culture.

asr-002095
02:15:52.160 --> 02:15:56.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And nakikita ko naman na ine-endeavor ng duty-free shops natin.

asr-002096
02:15:56.540 --> 02:16:03.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To do the same, lalo na at may historical importance at pagtangi din sa kanila.

asr-002097
02:16:04.260 --> 02:16:14.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Though, nabalitaan natin na yung essentially main mall ng ating duty-free shops, yung Fiesta Mall, ay magsasara na.

asr-002098
02:16:15.400 --> 02:16:19.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At magda-downsize sila sa isang office sa Paranaque.

asr-002099
02:16:19.540 --> 02:16:26.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May I ask po, ano po yung update doon? Bakit po nag-decide na i-close yung Fiesta Mall?

asr-002100
02:16:26.540 --> 02:16:31.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And bakit po lilipat yung office, yung duty-free shop natin?

asr-002101
02:16:33.540 --> 02:16:40.420
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: May we refer this to COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco, Chief Operating Officer.

asr-002102
02:16:40.440 --> 02:16:42.560
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: COO Joel Cinco, you're recognized.

asr-002103
02:16:46.160 --> 02:16:50.600
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Thank you, Madam Chair. Thank you, Madam Secretary. Good evening, Your Honor.

asr-002104
02:16:50.600 --> 02:16:57.240
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: As to the concern po sa Fiesta Mall, just to clarify,

asr-002105
02:16:57.240 --> 02:17:00.460
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: hindi po siya magsasara.

asr-002106
02:17:01.220 --> 02:17:05.880
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, what happened po, just to give you a background,

asr-002107
02:17:06.460 --> 02:17:13.860
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: kasi nag-expire yung lease agreement po noong last June.

asr-002108
02:17:14.440 --> 02:17:25.460
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, we had an option to right-size, mainly because as to ano po, we're incurring—mataas ho kasi yung renta.

asr-002109
02:17:25.460 --> 02:17:27.060
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: And for us to be able...

asr-002110
02:17:27.240 --> 02:17:32.520
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, to cope up with the operating expenses,

asr-002111
02:17:33.720 --> 02:17:39.620
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: in-identify po namin yung mga areas na pwede namin i-right size.

asr-002112
02:17:40.300 --> 02:17:43.080
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Since we are a self-sustaining agency.

asr-002113
02:17:43.660 --> 02:17:44.640
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, ganun po yung ginawa.

asr-002114
02:17:44.640 --> 02:17:49.900
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, and yung lessor po namin,

asr-002115
02:17:51.640 --> 02:17:54.700
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: so, nung nag-expire po yung kontrata, yung lessor po namin,

asr-002116
02:17:55.280 --> 02:17:56.640
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: there was...

asr-002117
02:17:57.240 --> 02:18:00.800
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: there was a new upcoming lessor.

asr-002118
02:18:01.660 --> 02:18:04.620
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Ang plano po nila is to revive.

asr-002119
02:18:05.440 --> 02:18:08.780
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, i-redevelop po ang Fiesta Mall.

asr-002120
02:18:09.400 --> 02:18:12.660
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, magkakaroon po, kasi right now, kung mapapansin nyo,

asr-002121
02:18:13.800 --> 02:18:15.440
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: nawala po yung mga kainan.

asr-002122
02:18:16.340 --> 02:18:20.640
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, nawala po talaga ng activity yung area po.

asr-002123
02:18:20.640 --> 02:18:26.860
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, with the new lessor po, ang plano po nila is really to redevelop.

asr-002124
02:18:27.240 --> 02:18:29.100
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: I-revive yung complex.

asr-002125
02:18:30.060 --> 02:18:33.440
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: And si Duty Free Philippines po ay magiging anchor tenant.

asr-002126
02:18:33.800 --> 02:18:39.940
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Which, yun po yung tinitingnan namin na anggulo whether to pursue.

asr-002127
02:18:40.780 --> 02:18:47.620
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: But at this point po, tuloy-tuloy lang po yung operations ni Duty Free Philippines po sa Fiesta Mall.

asr-002128
02:18:47.760 --> 02:18:48.940
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: At hindi po magsasara.

asr-002129
02:18:49.740 --> 02:18:52.400
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: As to yung office naman po,

asr-002130
02:18:52.760 --> 02:18:55.240
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: as part of our efforts to...

asr-002131
02:18:57.240 --> 02:18:59.320
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: address the high-rising cost mo.

asr-002132
02:18:59.960 --> 02:19:04.400
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Kasi po before, yung complex composed of the...

asr-002133
02:19:04.400 --> 02:19:06.340
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: may nandyan ho yung custom-bounded warehouse,

asr-002134
02:19:06.520 --> 02:19:07.520
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: nandyan ho yung mall,

asr-002135
02:19:08.160 --> 02:19:09.200
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: nandyan ho yung office.

asr-002136
02:19:09.900 --> 02:19:13.300
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, ngayon po, ang ginawa ho namin is to decentralize.

asr-002137
02:19:14.060 --> 02:19:20.680
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, yung office po na binanggit nyo na lilipat ho sa may Pasay.

asr-002138
02:19:21.380 --> 02:19:27.100
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, those are the cost-effective measures na in-employed,

asr-002139
02:19:27.240 --> 02:19:31.760
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: implement ho namin para ho maka-cope up si Duty Free Philippines po.

asr-002140
02:19:33.420 --> 02:19:39.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, to clarify, COO and Madam Chair,

asr-002141
02:19:40.260 --> 02:19:46.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung basically magkakaroon po ng ibang lessor.

asr-002142
02:19:47.280 --> 02:19:53.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And then, Duty Free will be instead paying rather than to kung sino man may-ari ng Fiesta Mall,

asr-002143
02:19:53.920 --> 02:19:54.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to this lessor.

asr-002144
02:19:54.580 --> 02:19:55.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sino pong lessor ito?

asr-002145
02:19:56.000 --> 02:19:56.940
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: It's a private.

asr-002146
02:19:57.240 --> 02:20:04.040
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: It's a private entity who's willing to invest to redevelop the area.

asr-002147
02:20:05.240 --> 02:20:07.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And when you mean anchor-tenant,

asr-002148
02:20:08.060 --> 02:20:12.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung character ng pagiging duty-free ng Fiesta Mall will maintain?

asr-002149
02:20:13.300 --> 02:20:17.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or mag-iiba po ba yung essentially characteristics neto?

asr-002150
02:20:17.640 --> 02:20:24.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And isang bahagi na lang, kumbaga, yung duty-free ng i-redevelop na Fiesta Mall?

asr-002151
02:20:24.680 --> 02:20:26.720
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Essentially po, we will maintain.

asr-002152
02:20:27.240 --> 02:20:30.300
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Our, as an anchor-tenant.

asr-002153
02:20:30.300 --> 02:20:37.520
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: But ang plano ho gawin, yung bagong lessor is to redevelop and complement

asr-002154
02:20:37.520 --> 02:20:40.600
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: kung ano ho yung meron tayo right now sa duty-free.

asr-002155
02:20:40.800 --> 02:20:49.300
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, ang na-relay ho sa amin na plano is magkakaroon ho ng mga F&amp;Bs,

asr-002156
02:20:50.080 --> 02:20:56.000
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: mga restaurant po, to augment the experience po nung complex.

asr-002157
02:20:56.000 --> 02:21:04.020
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: At the same way, magkakaroon ho ng mga ibang tenants that would complement with us.

asr-002158
02:21:04.140 --> 02:21:14.740
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Hindi ho siya magiging competing para ho to lift up yung presence ng Fiesta Mall

asr-002159
02:21:14.740 --> 02:21:17.720
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: at yung mga bago hong tenants na papasok.

asr-002160
02:21:18.900 --> 02:21:25.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, to clarify, Madam Chair, kaya po ba may right-sizing dahil po is duty-free?

asr-002161
02:21:26.000 --> 02:21:33.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Is it too expensive now to maintain compared to the income that it can generate for the Philippines?

asr-002162
02:21:34.220 --> 02:21:36.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano pong considerations bakit po nag-right-size?

asr-002163
02:21:36.820 --> 02:21:42.260
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Nag-right-size po mainly because, kasi po before, we used to occupy the entire complex.

asr-002164
02:21:42.940 --> 02:21:45.740
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: And we're not fully utilizing it.

asr-002165
02:21:45.740 --> 02:21:55.740
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, with right-sizing, basically po, we're utilizing the right space.

asr-002166
02:21:56.000 --> 02:22:04.320
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Kasi ngayon, kung titignan natin, mas maganda ho kung namamaximize yung income, yung sales,

asr-002167
02:22:04.500 --> 02:22:10.200
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: on the size, talaga hong requirement ni duty-free.

asr-002168
02:22:10.620 --> 02:22:13.000
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Kasi po dati, medyo malaki ho masyado.

asr-002169
02:22:14.720 --> 02:22:19.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Does duty-free have a right-sizing and asset disposition plan po ba, Madam Chair?

asr-002170
02:22:21.060 --> 02:22:24.000
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Regarding po sa, you mean sa space?

asr-002171
02:22:24.000 --> 02:22:25.920
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Sa buong ano po?

asr-002172
02:22:26.620 --> 02:22:31.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, and even kahit sa iba pong mga duty-free shops, if applicable,

asr-002173
02:22:31.440 --> 02:22:36.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron po bang ibang right-sizing efforts ngayon yung duty-free beyond yung sa Fiesta Mall?

asr-002174
02:22:36.960 --> 02:22:44.360
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: At this point po, yung Fiesta Mall lang po yung nag-implement po kami ng right-sizing.

asr-002175
02:22:45.060 --> 02:22:50.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay. Kung meron pong plan, can this representation receive a copy through the committee?

asr-002176
02:22:51.460 --> 02:22:53.760
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Will do, Madam Chair.

asr-002177
02:22:53.760 --> 02:22:54.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

asr-002178
02:22:54.300 --> 02:23:05.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I bring this up also, Madam Chair, because we are aware that merong mga retrenched employees before and up until now may outstanding claims.

asr-002179
02:23:06.120 --> 02:23:12.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, na-consider po ba kung paano babayaran yung claims na yun doon sa right-sizing na ginagawa?

asr-002180
02:23:12.720 --> 02:23:19.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya po bang punan yung claim nila in the midst of not only right-sizing,

asr-002181
02:23:19.740 --> 02:23:24.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero yung perception na nagbabayad ng masyadong malaki?

asr-002182
02:23:24.300 --> 02:23:33.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay. At hindi po na-utilize completely at therefore parang masayang kung tuloy-tuloy naman pong binabayaran yung Fiesta Mall?

asr-002183
02:23:33.740 --> 02:23:40.820
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Madam Chair, just to clarify po, the right-sizing pertains only to the space ng Fiesta Mall.

asr-002184
02:23:41.560 --> 02:23:47.560
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Though with the right-sizing po ng Fiesta Mall, wala hong affected na empleyado.

asr-002185
02:23:48.080 --> 02:23:53.560
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: I think you're pertaining po yung previous po na mga na...

asr-002186
02:23:54.300 --> 02:23:58.460
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: previously po, kasi yung nag-restructure noong 2023.

asr-002187
02:23:59.600 --> 02:24:08.380
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, kami po ay proactively nag-re-reach out po doon sa remaining employees na na-separate

asr-002188
02:24:08.380 --> 02:24:15.800
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: through issuing formal notices and extending HR assistance.

asr-002189
02:24:17.340 --> 02:24:23.800
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Primarily para ho mabayaran and ma-facilitate po yung mga naiwan ho ng mga...

asr-002190
02:24:24.300 --> 02:24:28.380
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: compensation na hindi pa ho natatanggap.

asr-002191
02:24:28.860 --> 02:24:34.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung maaari na lang po, Madam Chair, makapagsubmit din ng report tungkol sa ano pong progress noon.

asr-002192
02:24:35.300 --> 02:24:41.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ayaw naman po natin na dahil meron pa nga may outstanding claims na hindi mabayaran

asr-002193
02:24:41.660 --> 02:24:45.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: if in case may financial difficulties yung duty fee.

asr-002194
02:24:45.260 --> 02:24:50.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But kung ang nire-report naman ay may right-sizing na nangyayari,

asr-002195
02:24:51.560 --> 02:24:53.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and sa dulo po nito,

asr-002196
02:24:54.300 --> 02:24:56.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kaya pa rin mabayaran yung outstanding claims,

asr-002197
02:24:56.360 --> 02:24:59.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we'd like to receive the following updates through our report.

asr-002198
02:24:59.960 --> 02:25:01.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Would that be possible po, Madam Chair?

asr-002199
02:25:02.980 --> 02:25:05.020
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Opo, Madam Chair, makakaasa ho kayo.

asr-002200
02:25:05.240 --> 02:25:13.520
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Magpibigay ho kami ng updates as to the settlement ng mga remaining po.

asr-002201
02:25:14.520 --> 02:25:20.980
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: But definitely po, as to ano po, yung sa remaining ho na hindi pa ho nababayaran,

asr-002202
02:25:20.980 --> 02:25:22.140
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: naka-earmark na ho yun.

asr-002203
02:25:22.300 --> 02:25:23.980
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: So, may mga pending...

asr-002204
02:25:24.300 --> 02:25:30.440
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: Resolutions na lang ho, and mga GSIS clearances, yun na lang naman po yung mga kulang.

asr-002205
02:25:30.580 --> 02:25:35.620
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: But, naka-earmark na ho yan, kung ano ho yung mga yung resulta,

asr-002206
02:25:35.800 --> 02:25:39.980
DFPC COO Patrick Joel M. Cinco: makakaasa ho kayo na magkocomply ho kami.

asr-002207
02:25:41.620 --> 02:25:49.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: As a final question, Madam Chair, may partnerships po ba ang duty-free with local businesses,

asr-002208
02:25:51.320 --> 02:25:54.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with homegrown businesses of different regions,

asr-002209
02:25:54.300 --> 02:25:57.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na maaaring mas feature pa sa ating mga duty-free shops?

asr-002210
02:25:58.360 --> 02:26:02.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano po bang, essentially, business model na inooperating ngayon ng duty-free?

asr-002211
02:26:02.200 --> 02:26:10.180
